      info
          - renders this group as pattern text, with a named or plain capturing parenthesis
          + rend ce groupe en texte de motif, avec une parenthèse capturante nommée ou simple
      detail
          - Given the whole pattern, the next capture index and whether to name the group
          - `(?<gN>…)`, returns the index after this group and its text; a quantified
          - parenthesised group gains an inner `(…)` so the name wraps the whole repetition. Used
          - by `Regex.makePattern`.
          + À partir du motif entier, de l'indice de capture suivant et de l'indication de nommer ou
          + non le groupe `(?<gN>…)`, renvoie l'indice après ce groupe et son texte ; un groupe
          + entre parenthèses quantifié reçoit un `(…)` intérieur afin que le nom englobe toute la
          + répétition. Utilisé par `Regex.makePattern`.
  entry .Error
    info
        - raised when a pattern cannot be parsed: the position and the reason
        + levée quand un motif ne peut pas être analysé : la position et la raison
    detail
        - Error 397: _the regular expression could not be parsed because `reason` at `index`_,
        - with the reason's number as the error's sub-number, so an unclosed group is
        - `SN-397.1`. Raised by `Regex.apply` and `Regex.parse` through a `Tactic[Regex.Error]`,
        - and reported as a compile error, pointing at the offending character, by `r"…"`. The
        - index counts characters of the parts joined together, with nothing standing in for
        - the `$name` substitutions.
        + Erreur 397 : _the regular expression could not be parsed because `reason` at `index`_,
        + avec le numéro de la raison comme sous-numéro de l'erreur, de sorte qu'un groupe non fermé
        + est `SN-397.1`. Levée par `Regex.apply` et `Regex.parse` par une `Tactic[Regex.Error]`, et
        + signalée comme erreur de compilation, désignant le caractère fautif, par `r"…"`. L'indice
        + compte les caractères des parties jointes ensemble, sans rien à la place des substitutions
        + `$name`.

        ```scala
        import soundness.*

        safely(Regex(t"aa(bb){2,1}c"))   // Unset: Regex.Error(9, BadRepetition)
        ```
    entry .Reason
      info
          - why a pattern was rejected, as one of eleven numbered cases
          + la raison du rejet d'un motif, sous la forme de l'un de onze cas numérotés
      detail
          - Each case's `number` is the error's sub-number:
          + Le `number` de chaque cas est le sous-numéro de l'erreur :

          ```tabular
          - column  Case
          - column  Code
          - column  Message
          - column  Note
          - row  `UnclosedGroup`  1  _a capturing group was not closed_
          - row  `ExpectedGroup`  2  _a capturing group was expected immediately following an extractor_  a `$name` with no group after it
          - row  `BadRepetition`  3  _the maximum number of repetitions is less than the minimum_
          - row  `Uncapturable`  4  _a capturing group inside a repeating group can not be extracted_
          - row  `UnexpectedChar`  5  _the repetition range contained an unexpected character_
          - row  `NotInGroup`  6  _a closing parenthesis was found without a corresponding opening parenthesis_
          - row  `IncompleteRepetition`  7  _the repetition range was not closed_
          - row  `InvalidPattern`  8  _the pattern was invalid_  anything `java.util.regex` rejects that the parser did not
          - row  `UnclosedEscape`  9  _nothing followed the escape character `\`_
          - row  `EmptyCharClass`  10  _the character class is empty_
          - row  `ZeroMaximum`  11  _the maximum number of repetitions must be greater than zero_
          + column  Cas
          + column  Code
          + column  Message
          + column  Remarque
          + row  `UnclosedGroup`  1  _a capturing group was not closed_
          + row  `ExpectedGroup`  2  _a capturing group was expected immediately following an extractor_  un `$name` qu'aucun groupe ne suit
          + row  `BadRepetition`  3  _the maximum number of repetitions is less than the minimum_
          + row  `Uncapturable`  4  _a capturing group inside a repeating group can not be extracted_
          + row  `UnexpectedChar`  5  _the repetition range contained an unexpected character_
          + row  `NotInGroup`  6  _a closing parenthesis was found without a corresponding opening parenthesis_
          + row  `IncompleteRepetition`  7  _the repetition range was not closed_
          + row  `InvalidPattern`  8  _the pattern was invalid_  tout ce que `java.util.regex` rejette et que l'analyseur n'a pas rejeté
          + row  `UnclosedEscape`  9  _nothing followed the escape character `\`_
          + row  `EmptyCharClass`  10  _the character class is empty_
          + row  `ZeroMaximum`  11  _the maximum number of repetitions must be greater than zero_
          ```
      entry .communicable
        info
            - renders each reason as the message quoted on `Regex.Error.Reason`
            + rend chaque raison sous la forme du message cité sur `Regex.Error.Reason`
      entry #number
        info
            - the reason's number, 1 to 11, which is the sub-number of its `Regex.Error`
            + le numéro de la raison, de 1 à 11, qui est le sous-numéro de sa `Regex.Error`
